flowchart TD
    A[User brief] --> B[Planner: master prompt]
    B --> C[Script and narration]
    C --> D[Storyboard: scenes, 4 to 8 s shots]
    D --> E[Lock assets: style bible, character and product references]
    E --> F[Keyframe per shot]
    F --> G{Keyframe approved?}
    G -- No --> F
    G -- Yes --> H[Router: capability, licence verdict, cost]
    H --> I[Generate clip]
    I --> J[Technical QC: ffprobe, black, freeze]
    J -- Fail --> K{Attempts left?}
    J -- Pass --> L[Semantic QC: vision LLM]
    L -- Defect found --> M[Repair: edit keyframe or prompt]
    M --> I
    L -- Pass --> N[Normalise, colour match, captions, audio mix]
    K -- Yes --> I
    K -- No --> O[Flag shot for human review]
    N --> P[Final QC]
    P --> Q[Final video and manifest]
